## Where does this new code go?

<!-- GEN: Decision tree using the project's layers and real paths. Top to bottom, stop at the first "yes". -->
1. Takes input / renders / defines a route? → `{{presentation_path}}`
2. Orchestrates a business operation (several steps, a transaction)? → `{{application_path}}`
3. A pure business concept or rule, no I/O? → `{{domain_path}}`
4. Talks to a DB / API / file / SDK? → `{{infrastructure_path}}`
5. Purely technical and used across features? → `{{shared_path}}` (per the shared-code rules)
6. Unsure → ask the user; do not invent a new folder.

