## Creating a new folder

- Only create a folder when there are ≥ 2 files with the same role, or the folder already exists in tree 01.
- A folder not in tree 01 → ask the user, then update 01 and 02.
- Never create new `utils/`, `helpers/`, `misc/`, `common/` folders inside a feature.

## Checklist when creating a file

- [ ] Right folder per the decision tree
- [ ] Right naming pattern
- [ ] A single responsibility
- [ ] Imports in the allowed direction (see 05)
- [ ] Has tests if it contains logic
- [ ] Exported through the public API if other features need it

